@startuml
title APT-SD-D07 Payment Finality, Fiscal Issuance, and ExitAuthorization Status Display Sequence
skinparam shadowing false

participant "Assisted Payment Terminal" as APT
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Payment Orchestrator" as Pay
participant "Site POS Server" as POS
participant "Audit / Event" as Audit

APT -> Central : request payment initiation
Central -> Pay : provider workflow
Pay --> Central : verified provider outcome
Central -> Central : record payment finality
Central --> APT : display Central PMS finality status
Central -> POS : request Sales Invoice issuance
POS --> Central : issued / failed / timeout status
alt fiscal issued
  Central -> Central : record fiscal reference
  Central -> Central : issue ExitAuthorization if eligible
  Central --> APT : display fiscal and exit status
else fiscal pending or failed
  Central --> APT : display fiscal pending/failed and exit pending
end
Central -> Audit : payment/fiscal/exit status context

note bottom
Provider outcome is evidence.
APT displays backend status only.
end note
@enduml
